# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PepeTrip — FRONTEND (Vite) environment
# Copy to frontend/.env. Vite only reads files in THIS folder, and only exposes
# vars prefixed with VITE_ to the browser. Never put secrets here — anything
# here ships to the client. (The Google client id is NOT needed here; the app
# fetches it from the backend's /api/v1/config endpoint.)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base URL of the API. Leave EMPTY for same-origin:
#   • production  → backend serves the SPA, so same origin (empty).
#   • local dev   → the Vite proxy forwards /api and /uploads to :4000 (empty).
# Only set this if you host the frontend on a different origin than the API,
# e.g. VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
